    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>ContextLoadException</code> for the supplied\n<a href=\"../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Throwable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为提供的<a href=\"../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>和<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Throwable</code></a>创建一个新的<code>ContextLoadException</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This exception provides access to the <a href=\"#getApplicationContext()\">application context</a> that failed to load as well as the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html#getCause()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">exception</a> caught while attempting to load that context.",
      "translation": "此异常提供了无法加载的 <a href=\"#getApplicationContext()\">application context</a> 以及尝试加载该上下文时捕获的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html#getCause()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">exception</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Clients must not retain a long-lived reference to the context returned\nfrom this method.",
      "translation": "客户端不得保留从此方法返回的上下文的长期引用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
